# Every text file is stored LF in the repository and checked out in the
# platform's own convention, CRLF on Windows. Without this the result depends on
# whoever cloned it: with core.autocrlf unset a Windows clone gets LF, and the
# next tool that rewrites a file with os.linesep turns it into a whole-file CRLF
# diff. scripts/stamp_headers.py was that tool.
* text=auto

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.dll  binary
*.vpk  binary
